<h1 class="contract">init</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Initialize BP Application Contract
summary: 'Initialize the admin account for flon.applybp'
---

{{$action.account}} initializes the block producer application contract admin as {{admin}}.

<h1 class="contract">applybp</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Apply as Block Producer
summary: '{{owner}} submits a block producer application'
---

{{owner}} submits block producer application information.

<h1 class="contract">updatebp</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Update Block Producer Application
summary: '{{owner}} updates a block producer application'
---

{{owner}} updates existing block producer application information.

<h1 class="contract">addproducer</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Add Block Producer Application
summary: '{{submiter}} adds or updates producer information for {{owner}}'
---

{{submiter}} adds or updates block producer application information for {{owner}}.

<h1 class="contract">setstatus</h1>

---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Set Producer Application Status
summary: '{{submiter}} sets {{owner}} status to {{status}}'
---

{{submiter}} sets the block producer application status for {{owner}}.
